UniswapSwapModule_RemoveRouter
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when router is not in whitelist
│   └── it should revert with UniswapSwapModule_RouterNotAllowed
└── when all validations pass
    ├── it should remove the router from whitelist
    ├── it should emit RouterRemoved
    ├── it should return false for isRouterAllowed
    └── it should allow re-adding the router after removal
